WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.100
Register the model and its operating contract.

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:06.600
Measure environmental impact and expose the decision boundary.

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:10.100
Link each claim to evidence with a declared capability state.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:13.600
Hold release when policy, evidence, or mitigation is incomplete.

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:17.100
Turn blockers into owned remediation and re-test work.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:21.100
Export the approval state and supporting audit story.
